WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:07.060
Yo Taylor, I’m really happy for you, Ima
let you finish.

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:11.450
But Beyonce had one of the best videos of
all time.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:17.310
Kanye West’s interruption of Taylor Swift’s
acceptance speech at the MTV video music awards

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:23.500
was shocking, but crazy antics like this are
par for the course for Kanye West.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.529
It’s just Kanye being Kanye.

00:00:26.529 --> 00:00:31.779
Yet that moment in 2009 is nothing compared
to his latest controversies.

00:00:31.779 --> 00:00:38.270
Kanye West has single-handedly destroyed all
that he has worked so hard to achieve.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:43.700
The final nail in the coffin came just after
Elon Musk lifted his ban and he was welcomed

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:44.950
back to Twitter.

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:49.920
He then got himself kicked off again after
tweeting out a photo of a swuh-stika symbol

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:54.890
inside a Star of David, which we’ve blurred
because it’s not appropriate to show.

00:00:54.890 --> 00:01:00.920
Musk said the rapper violated the platform’s
rule against prohibiting incitement to violence.

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:05.080
Kanye’s career is officially up in flames.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:11.110
And you can forget about him running for President
in 2024…not that anyone took him seriously.

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:14.460
His fall from grace has actually been years
in the making.

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:18.820
In 2018, things appeared to be going well
for Kanye West.

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:23.880
He seemed happy with his wife Kim Kardashian
and was preparing to release a new album.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:27.780
But take a closer look, and there were noticeable
cracks.

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:33.450
His album Ye was delayed repeatedly before
finally being released to less than glowing

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:34.780
reviews.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:39.020
He would officially change his name to just
Ye, with no last name.

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:44.460
There were indications on the album cover
of Ye that something wasn’t quite right.

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:49.710
He apparently snapped this photo of the mountains
in Wyoming on his iPhone and scribbled the

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:53.579
words: “I hate being bipolar, it’s awesome.”

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:58.350
Kanye was diagnosed with bipolar disorder
in 2016.

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:03.390
According to the American Psychiatric Association,
people with the mental illness can experience

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:08.319
“intense emotional states” which can result
in “risky behavior”.

00:02:08.319 --> 00:02:11.910
Ye’s state of mind was pretty evident.

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:17.880
After his flurry of antisemitic posts on Instagram,
which got removed, he took to Twitter to lash

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:20.780
out at Instagram’s CEO Mark Zuckerberg.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:23.780
But then he got banned on Twitter in December.

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:29.880
And switched back to Instagram, where he bizarrely
accused Musk of being a half-Chinese genetic

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:31.730
hybrid.

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:36.720
The same week he got booted from Twitter - he
appeared on conspiracy theorist Alex Jones’

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:42.560
show wearing a full black mask, in which he
made it known that he liked Hitler, that he

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:47.800
had a lot of redeeming qualities, and he denied
the Holocaust ever happened.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:52.660
Some even remarked that he made Alex Jones
look sane for once!

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:58.430
He kept up the full face mask look for a subsequent
interview on Censored.tv.

00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:03.980
How many times do I have to prove, how many
times do I have to do something like so miraculous

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:07.780
for people to see that it’s brilliant, that
it’s not mental health.

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:13.860
Like me wearing a mask gives me this ability
to not have to worry about showing my face

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:16.620
so I can think about what I am saying.

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:23.519
There was also the time he recently stormed
off political commentator Tim Pool’s podcast

00:03:23.519 --> 00:03:26.780
after Pool appeared to challenge his negative
views of Jewish people.

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:27.780
You leaving?

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:28.780
https://www.mirror.co.uk/3am/us-celebrity-news/kanye-west-stands-luxury-fashion-28635653

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:31.720
He went out the door, and so, it seems, has
his entire career.

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:32.720
He’s gone.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:36.709
It would take a miracle for him to make a
comeback after all that’s happened.

00:03:36.709 --> 00:03:42.599
And he’s already been gifted a miracle once
before when he nearly died.

00:03:42.599 --> 00:03:47.890
In 2002, after a late night at a studio in
California, he fell asleep at the wheel and

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:51.510
collided with another vehicle, shattering
his jaw.

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:57.290
His jaw was wired to his face during reconstructive
surgery…which inspired his hit single “Through

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:58.590
the Wire”.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:03.230
Up until then, he had long been boxed in as
a producer, and was never taken seriously

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:04.810
as a rapper.

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:08.500
But the car crash hit him with a burst of
creativity.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:17.470
His 2004 debut album College Dropout received
critical acclaim with tracks like Jesus Walks.

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:19.320
And then he kept rising.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:23.620
His sixth studio album, Yeezus, was out of
this world.

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:25.740
West seemed unstoppable.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.580
And so, apparently, was his ego.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.800
He called himself the next Steve Jobs - a
visionary.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:37.070
At one point, he was believed to be the wealthiest
musician on the planet.

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:43.449
Forbes estimated that he had a net worth of
$2 billion in 2022 before it all came crashing

00:04:43.449 --> 00:04:44.590
down.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:49.880
Adidas stopped selling his Yeezy sneakers
because of his antisemitic rants.

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:51.630
Gap cut ties with him.

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:57.509
So did Balenciaga, the fashion house he controversially
stood up for when it launched an ad campaign

00:04:57.509 --> 00:05:01.570
with children holding teddy bears in bondage
gear.

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:07.500
Behind the eyebrow raising rants lay a troubled
man whose manic episodes had concerned his

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:08.830
then-wife.

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:14.670
In 2020, Kim Kardashian posted an Instagram
Story about his bipolar disorder for the first

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:15.670
time.

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:21.150
“Anyone who has this or has a loved one
in their life who does, knows how incredibly

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:24.850
complicated and painful it is to understand.”

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:29.650
She said she felt the need to speak out publicly
"because of the stigma and misconceptions

00:05:29.650 --> 00:05:31.229
about mental health.”

00:05:31.229 --> 00:05:36.130
Kardashian also mentioned that the “painful
loss of his mother” greatly affected him.

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:42.160
Kanye was incredibly close to his mum Dr.
Donda West, an English professor at Chicago

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:43.800
State University.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:50.430
She died unexpectedly of a heart attack in
2007 at the age of just 58 after getting several

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:52.270
cosmetic surgeries.

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:55.280
He named his 2021 album after her.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:06:00.039
The album had no cover art; it was simply
a black square.

00:06:00.039 --> 00:06:05.430
Kardashian ended her Instagram post by pleading
that the media and the public give her family

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:10.160
the compassion and empathy needed to get through
this.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:13.930
Instead of the spotlight, instead of being
surrounded by people telling him how great

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:19.810
he was, instead of fame, fortune, and fans,
Kanye needed…help.

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:25.530
It’s difficult to see someone go from the
highest of highs to the lowest of lows.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:30.740
His breakdown has caused him to lose everything
that our society seems to cherish.

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:31.740
Fortune.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:32.740
Power.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:33.740
Status.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:34.740
Influence.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:41.330
Kim and Kanye also split in 2021 after six
years of marriage and four children.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:45.919
Kanye West has a song on his fifth album called
Lost in the World.

00:06:45.919 --> 00:06:48.040
It begins with the lyrics:

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:51.789
“I'm up in the woods
I'm down on my mind

00:06:51.789 --> 00:06:56.139
I'm building a still
To slow down the time”

00:06:56.139 --> 00:07:02.150
It’s about those who want to stop and clear
their minds to find themselves.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:05.680
Perhaps a lesson for himself.

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:10.449
With the controversy surrounding him, and
brands dropping him left, right, and center,

00:07:10.449 --> 00:07:14.490
Kanye West is reportedly no longer a billionaire.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:18.780
Many billionaires have found alternative ways
to grow their wealth with the stock market

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:20.020
looking shaky.

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:25.940
A recent survey found many financial advisors
are branching out from the typical portfolio

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:27.690
of stocks and bonds.

